+    preserve visibility into omitted support files. Direct ``file_path`` reads
+    return earlier in :func:`skill_view` and are therefore unchanged.
+
+    Rollback/override controls, read on every call:
+
+    - ``skills.linked_files_mode`` in config: ``auto`` (default), ``compact``,
+      or ``full``.
+    - ``metadata.hermes.linked_files_mode`` in SKILL.md overrides config for
+      one skill.
+    - ``skills.linked_files_compact_threshold`` changes the auto threshold
+      (default 40 total files).
